ng vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z3qZRVwOvHkQ7kNvwEiUl7B&_nc_oc=Adk5Il41muRZknv1Vpn67ubU2s4W7N1WKs8INnjJHobzCuaKh7RiVh8G6lufJ_PiNPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxkW9fkzkq07q8wCWQfLTZLaav7Rc2NHX8rbbHccBWAZQ&oe=69BD2D01"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WJ2TisByeHAQ7kNvwFRHT8s&_nc_oc=Adk0J-9J2FSH2dOJR8Raw1JGow5HracgjF1SmuoB6RJsK82ULyH1QBqt26be73UW2oo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyonHWf468DPc2h-Ck5kRNUtFFCP1D1s5wJ70bh5akUuw&oe=69BD3A66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GGAoE41FflYQ7kNvwGmG4Iz&_nc_oc=Adm_mz4hp8isMnNt96gbkq79V2izVsfDST5-qhiqsWzPAAEdQhTY0fsjeFKagOt9REE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss